cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ISLES'26 Ischemic Stroke Lesion Segmentation Pipeline"
abstract: >
  Production-grade PyTorch Lightning pipeline for the ISLES'26 Grand
  Challenge. Implements NNUNet-style DynUNet with FiLM conditioning,
  deep supervision, weighted lesion sampling, adaptive post-processing,
  and stratified evaluation for single-modality T1w MRI stroke segmentation
  across ~2 000 scans from 60+ acquisition centres.
version: "1.0.0"
